WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.906
Great quarter. You hired five people. And your CRM billed you for every one of them. Since when is growing a penalty?

2
00:00:09.206 --> 00:00:19.409
Per seat. Per hub. Required onboarding on Pro plans. And add-ons. All for a CRM built for generic sales teams, not for jobs, sites, and service.

3
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:24.584
Meet Ardn CRM. Grow your team, not your CRM bill.

4
00:00:25.884 --> 00:00:31.278
See the health of your business at a glance, then every deal in your pipeline, by stage, and what it's worth.

5
00:00:33.178 --> 00:00:40.874
Open any deal, and everything is right there. Its value, its odds, the contact, and a timeline of every call, email, and note.

6
00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:48.378
Build the quote from your own product list and send it. When the customer says yes, turn it into a job, in one click.

7
00:00:50.278 --> 00:00:59.318
When a customer calls, the request runs on an SLA clock. If it starts to slip, it's escalated automatically. And after the visit, the customer rates it.

8
00:01:00.778 --> 00:01:08.309
And every account shows its lifetime value, its contacts, and its open work, so your team walks into every conversation prepared.

9
00:01:09.609 --> 00:01:16.708
With Ardn, pricing is based on the modules and locations you run, never on how many people log in. So you can hire freely.

10
00:01:18.309 --> 00:01:25.813
Switching is on us. We move your contacts, companies, deals, and history off HubSpot. You review it, and your team starts.

11
00:01:27.113 --> 00:01:34.123
Grow your team, not your CRM bill. See your savings at Ardn Cloud Solutions dot com, then book a thirty-minute call.
